线条对比。阳光从右上方洒落（暖调自然光），在肌肤上投下柔和阴影与高光点，突出立体轮廓的同时保留温柔氛围；泳池波光粼粼反射天光，营造夏日清凉气息。\n\n远处背景中可见模糊行人与现代建筑剪影，增强空间纵深感但不喧宾夺主——整体画面干净通透、色彩饱和却不刺眼，充满高级度假杂志封面质感。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Text String (User Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [570, 800], "pos": [-2001.399658203125, -351.9044494628906], "id": 63, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [214], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [450, 140], "pos": [-1390.1959228515625, -468.56915283203125], "widgets_values": ["pornmasterKrea2_v2TurboBF16.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "weight_dtype"}], "flags": {}, "id": 109, "type": "UNETLoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"directory_invalid": true, "name": "krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors", "directory": "diffusion_models", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors"}], "ver": "0.25.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [210], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [-667.3575439453125, -726.70556640625], "widgets_values": ["小红书微胖st2000.safetensors", 0.9000000000000001], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 214, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "label": "lora_